<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Sad Machine (Live)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Porter Robinson"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Secret Sky 2021 (Live)"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1864857546"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="235518886"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="chan-air"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:53.282"><div begin="00:00.000" end="04:53.282"><p begin="00:00.000" end="00:05.984" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L0"><span begin="00:00.000" end="00:00.181">The</span> <span begin="00:00.181" end="00:00.470">best</span> <span begin="00:00.470" end="00:00.714">sort</span> <span begin="00:00.714" end="00:00.938">of</span> <span begin="00:00.938" end="00:01.001">in</span><span begin="00:01.001" end="00:01.138">ner</span> <span begin="00:01.138" end="00:01.690">voice</span> <span begin="00:01.961" end="00:02.407">speaks</span> <span begin="00:02.407" end="00:02.497">to</span> <span begin="00:02.497" end="00:02.903">us</span> <span begin="00:02.903" end="00:03.010">in</span> <span begin="00:03.010" end="00:03.187">a</span> <span begin="00:03.187" end="00:03.487">gen</span><span begin="00:03.487" end="00:03.927">tle,</span> <span begin="00:03.927" end="00:04.352">kind,</span> <span begin="00:04.352" end="00:04.704">and</span> <span begin="00:04.704" end="00:04.921">u</span><span begin="00:04.921" end="00:05.231">nhur</span><span begin="00:05.231" end="00:05.511">ried</span> <span begin="00:05.511" end="00:05.984">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">至善至美的内心指引 犹如在与我们温良从容地对话</span></p><p begin="00:06.662" end="00:11.426" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:06.662" end="00:06.807">It</span> <span begin="00:06.807" end="00:07.047">should</span> <span begin="00:07.047" end="00:07.507">feel</span> <span begin="00:07.507" end="00:07.652">as</span> <span begin="00:07.652" end="00:07.795">if</span> <span begin="00:07.795" end="00:07.979">a</span> <span begin="00:07.979" end="00:08.277">sym</span><span begin="00:08.277" end="00:08.429">pa</span><span begin="00:08.429" end="00:08.604">the</span><span begin="00:08.604" end="00:08.853">tic</span> <span begin="00:08.853" end="00:09.321">arm</span> <span begin="00:09.321" end="00:09.521">were</span> <span begin="00:09.521" end="00:09.608">be</span><span begin="00:09.608" end="00:09.812">ing</span> <span begin="00:09.812" end="00:10.088">put</span> <span begin="00:10.088" end="00:10.193">a</span><span begin="00:10.193" end="00:10.527">round</span> <span begin="00:10.527" end="00:10.854">our</span> <span begin="00:10.854" end="00:11.163">shoul</span><span begin="00:11.163" end="00:11.426">der</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">仿佛是将我们搂入那满是同情的臂弯中</span></p><p begin="00:12.119" end="00:16.706" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:12.119" end="00:12.393">By</span> <span begin="00:12.393" end="00:12.605">some</span><span begin="00:12.605" end="00:12.830">one</span> <span begin="00:12.830" end="00:13.038">who</span> <span begin="00:13.038" end="00:13.247">had</span> <span begin="00:13.247" end="00:13.610">lived</span> <span begin="00:13.610" end="00:14.294">long</span> <span begin="00:14.294" end="00:14.416">and</span> <span begin="00:14.416" end="00:14.704">seen</span> <span begin="00:14.704" end="00:14.857">a</span> <span begin="00:14.857" end="00:15.328">great</span> <span begin="00:15.328" end="00:15.491">ma</span><span begin="00:15.491" end="00:15.769">ny</span> <span begin="00:15.769" end="00:16.117">sad</span> <span begin="00:16.117" end="00:16.706">things</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:19.434" end="00:26.188"><span begin="00:19.434" end="00:20.004">(Does</span> <span begin="00:20.004" end="00:20.247">a</span><span begin="00:20.247" end="00:21.316">ny</span><span begin="00:21.316" end="00:22.694">one</span> <span begin="00:22.694" end="00:26.188">there?)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有人吗？</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而那正出自于 一位饱经风霜的长者</span></p><p begin="00:27.606" end="00:28.064" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:27.606" end="00:28.064">Play!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">来！</span></p><p begin="01:11.783" end="01:16.203" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="01:11.783" end="01:12.397">Who</span> <span begin="01:12.397" end="01:12.774">sur</span><span begin="01:12.774" end="01:13.816">vived?</span> <span begin="01:14.274" end="01:14.751">Some</span><span begin="01:14.751" end="01:15.017">bo</span><span begin="01:15.017" end="01:15.421">dy</span> <span begin="01:15.421" end="01:16.203">new?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">还有谁存活了下来？有人吗？</span></p><p begin="01:17.108" end="01:20.396" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="01:17.108" end="01:17.463">A</span><span begin="01:17.463" end="01:17.816">ny</span><span begin="01:17.816" end="01:18.191">one</span> <span begin="01:18.191" end="01:18.875">else</span> <span begin="01:19.217" end="01:19.592">but</span> <span begin="01:19.592" end="01:20.396">you?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">除你之外 还有别人吗？</span></p><p begin="01:21.749" end="01:27.665" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="01:21.749" end="01:22.230">On</span> <span begin="01:22.230" end="01:22.611">a</span> <span begin="01:22.611" end="01:23.163">lone</span><span begin="01:23.163" end="01:23.487">ly</span> <span begin="01:23.487" end="01:24.227">night</span> <span begin="01:24.980" end="01:25.160">was</span> <span begin="01:25.160" end="01:25.325">a</span> <span begin="01:25.325" end="01:25.684">blin</span><span begin="01:25.684" end="01:26.364">ding</span> <span begin="01:26.364" end="01:27.665">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">孤夜 盲灯</span></p><p begin="01:28.330" end="01:32.074" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="01:28.330" end="01:28.764">A</span> <span begin="01:28.764" end="01:29.035">hun</span><span begin="01:29.035" end="01:29.358">dred</span> <span begin="01:29.358" end="01:29.693">lea</span><span begin="01:29.693" end="01:30.043">ders</span> <span begin="01:30.043" end="01:30.306">would</span> <span begin="01:30.306" end="01:30.792">be</span> <span begin="01:30.792" end="01:31.361">borne</span> <span begin="01:31.361" end="01:31.606">of</span> <span begin="01:31.606" end="01:32.074">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">成千上万的精灵 会为你而生 照你前路</span></p><p begin="01:32.439" end="01:37.867" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="01:32.439" end="01:32.667">And</span> <span begin="01:32.667" end="01:32.953">though</span> <span begin="01:32.953" end="01:33.343">I</span> <span begin="01:33.343" end="01:33.859">know,</span> <span begin="01:35.089" end="01:35.404">since</span> <span begin="01:35.404" end="01:35.859">you've</span> <span begin="01:35.859" end="01:36.087">a</span><span begin="01:36.087" end="01:36.469">wa</span><span begin="01:36.469" end="01:36.789">kened</span> <span begin="01:36.789" end="01:37.108">her</span> <span begin="01:37.108" end="01:37.321">a</span><span begin="01:37.321" end="01:37.867">gain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">尽管我明白 自从你再度唤醒她后</span></p><p begin="01:38.105" end="01:43.251" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:38.105" end="01:38.468">She</span> <span begin="01:38.468" end="01:38.652">de</span><span begin="01:38.652" end="01:39.486">pends</span> <span begin="01:39.486" end="01:40.005">on</span> <span begin="01:40.005" end="01:40.584">you,</span> <span begin="01:40.853" end="01:41.178">she</span> <span begin="01:41.178" end="01:41.393">de</span><span begin="01:41.393" end="01:42.276">pends</span> <span begin="01:42.276" end="01:42.761">on</span> <span begin="01:42.761" end="01:43.251">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她唯独的依靠只有你 只有你</span></p><p begin="01:43.251" end="01:48.662" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:43.251" end="01:43.536">She'll</span> <span begin="01:43.536" end="01:44.031">go</span> <span begin="01:44.031" end="01:44.178">a</span><span begin="01:44.178" end="01:44.611">lone,</span> <span begin="01:45.884" end="01:46.185">and</span> <span begin="01:46.185" end="01:46.652">ne</span><span begin="01:46.652" end="01:46.977">ver</span> <span begin="01:46.977" end="01:47.340">speak</span> <span begin="01:47.340" end="01:47.664">of</span> <span begin="01:47.664" end="01:48.005">this</span> <span begin="01:48.005" end="01:48.145">a</span><span begin="01:48.145" end="01:48.662">gain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她将孤身离去 不再提及往事</span></p><p begin="01:48.960" end="01:54.056" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:48.960" end="01:49.357">We</span> <span begin="01:49.357" end="01:49.524">de</span><span begin="01:49.524" end="01:50.352">pend</span> <span begin="01:50.352" end="01:50.862">on</span> <span begin="01:50.862" end="01:51.360">you,</span> <span begin="01:51.647" end="01:52.098">we</span> <span begin="01:52.098" end="01:52.225">de</span><span begin="01:52.225" end="01:53.029">pend</span> <span begin="01:53.029" end="01:53.575">on</span> <span begin="01:53.575" end="01:54.056">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可我们还需要你 还依靠你</span></p><p begin="01:54.056" end="01:59.542" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:54.056" end="01:54.365">And</span> <span begin="01:54.365" end="01:54.800">though</span> <span begin="01:54.800" end="01:55.134">I</span> <span begin="01:55.134" end="01:55.634">know,</span> <span begin="01:56.813" end="01:57.132">since</span> <span begin="01:57.132" end="01:57.489">you've</span> <span begin="01:57.489" end="01:57.794">a</span><span begin="01:57.794" end="01:58.148">wa</span><span begin="01:58.148" end="01:58.477">kened</span> <span begin="01:58.477" end="01:58.836">her</span> <span begin="01:58.836" end="01:59.011">a</span><span begin="01:59.011" end="01:59.542">gain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">尽管我明白 自从你再度唤醒她后</span></p><p begin="01:59.799" end="02:04.925" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:59.799" end="02:00.207">She</span> <span begin="02:00.207" end="02:00.397">de</span><span begin="02:00.397" end="02:01.248">pends</span> <span begin="02:01.248" end="02:01.724">on</span> <span begin="02:01.724" end="02:02.365">you,</span> <span begin="02:02.568" end="02:02.922">she</span> <span begin="02:02.922" end="02:03.105">de</span><span begin="02:03.105" end="02:03.925">pends</span> <span begin="02:03.925" end="02:04.429">on</span> <span begin="02:04.429" end="02:04.925">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她唯独的依靠只有你 只有你</span></p><p begin="02:04.925" end="02:10.404" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="02:04.925" end="02:05.222">She'll</span> <span begin="02:05.222" end="02:05.682">go</span> <span begin="02:05.682" end="02:05.795">a</span><span begin="02:05.795" end="02:06.382">lone,</span> <span begin="02:07.665" end="02:08.006">and</span> <span begin="02:08.006" end="02:08.353">ne</span><span begin="02:08.353" end="02:08.663">ver</span> <span begin="02:08.663" end="02:09.017">speak</span> <span begin="02:09.017" end="02:09.355">of</span> <span begin="02:09.355" end="02:09.710">this</span> <span begin="02:09.710" end="02:09.833">a</span><span begin="02:09.833" end="02:10.404">gain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她将孤身离去 不再提及往事</span></p><p begin="02:10.705" end="02:14.779" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="02:10.705" end="02:11.043">We</span> <span begin="02:11.043" end="02:11.220">de</span><span begin="02:11.220" end="02:12.062">pend</span> <span begin="02:12.062" end="02:12.585">on</span> <span begin="02:12.585" end="02:13.185">you,</span> <span begin="02:13.434" end="02:13.765">we</span> <span begin="02:13.765" end="02:13.927">de</span><span begin="02:13.927" end="02:14.779">pend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可我们还需要你 还依靠你</span></p><p begin="02:14.779" end="02:16.499" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="02:14.779" end="02:15.387">So</span> <span begin="02:15.387" end="02:16.104">tell</span> <span begin="02:16.104" end="02:16.499">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">愿你告诉我</span></p><p begin="02:59.331" end="03:03.801" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="02:59.331" end="02:59.591">I</span> <span begin="02:59.591" end="02:59.813">don't</span> <span begin="02:59.813" end="03:00.191">know</span> <span begin="03:00.191" end="03:00.519">much</span> <span begin="03:00.519" end="03:00.691">a</span><span begin="03:00.691" end="03:01.014">bout</span> <span begin="03:01.014" end="03:01.370">your</span> <span begin="03:01.370" end="03:01.879">life</span> <span begin="03:01.879" end="03:02.036">be</span><span begin="03:02.036" end="03:02.401">yond</span> <span begin="03:02.401" end="03:02.771">these</span> <span begin="03:02.771" end="03:03.801">walls</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不太了解你无所羁绊的生活</span></p><p begin="03:05.142" end="03:10.053" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="03:05.142" end="03:05.330">The</span> <span begin="03:05.330" end="03:05.873">flee</span><span begin="03:05.873" end="03:06.156">ting</span> <span begin="03:06.156" end="03:06.442">sense</span> <span begin="03:06.442" end="03:06.870">of</span> <span begin="03:06.870" end="03:07.307">love</span> <span begin="03:07.307" end="03:07.417">wi</span><span begin="03:07.417" end="03:07.761">thin</span> <span begin="03:07.761" end="03:08.202">these</span> <span begin="03:08.202" end="03:08.739">God</span> <span begin="03:08.739" end="03:08.896">for</span> <span begin="03:08.896" end="03:09.183">sa</span><span begin="03:09.183" end="03:09.555">ken</span> <span begin="03:09.555" end="03:10.053">halls</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">与在这些上帝遗弃的殿堂中 那转瞬即逝的爱意</span></p><p begin="03:10.071" end="03:14.323" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="03:10.071" end="03:10.356">And</span> <span begin="03:10.356" end="03:10.545">you</span> <span begin="03:10.545" end="03:10.899">can</span> <span begin="03:10.899" end="03:11.276">hear</span> <span begin="03:11.276" end="03:11.424">it</span> <span begin="03:11.424" end="03:11.849">in</span> <span begin="03:11.849" end="03:12.264">his</span> <span begin="03:12.264" end="03:12.768">voice,</span> <span begin="03:12.768" end="03:12.931">in</span> <span begin="03:12.931" end="03:13.231">e</span><span begin="03:13.231" end="03:13.564">very</span> <span begin="03:13.564" end="03:14.323">call</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在每次与他对话的声音中 你会明白</span></p><p begin="03:16.032" end="03:21.158" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="03:16.032" end="03:16.283">This</span> <span begin="03:16.283" end="03:16.631">girl</span> <span begin="03:16.631" end="03:16.981">who's</span> <span begin="03:16.981" end="03:17.295">slept</span> <span begin="03:17.295" end="03:17.646">a</span> <span begin="03:17.646" end="03:17.967">hun</span><span begin="03:17.967" end="03:18.281">dred</span> <span begin="03:18.281" end="03:18.666">years</span> <span begin="03:18.666" end="03:19.002">has</span> <span begin="03:19.002" end="03:19.291">some</span><span begin="03:19.291" end="03:19.632">thing</span> <span begin="03:19.632" end="03:20.014">af</span><span begin="03:20.014" end="03:20.325">ter</span> <span begin="03:20.325" end="03:21.158">all</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这沉睡百年的女孩 其实并非一无是处</span></p><p begin="03:43.019" end="03:49.285" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="03:43.019" end="03:43.107">And</span> <span begin="03:43.107" end="03:43.462">though</span> <span begin="03:43.462" end="03:43.862">I</span> <span begin="03:43.862" end="03:44.652">know,</span> <span begin="03:46.129" end="03:46.492">since</span> <span begin="03:46.492" end="03:46.907">you've</span> <span begin="03:46.907" end="03:47.207">a</span><span begin="03:47.207" end="03:47.694">wa</span><span begin="03:47.694" end="03:48.087">kened</span> <span begin="03:48.087" end="03:48.447">her</span> <span begin="03:48.447" end="03:48.642">a</span><span begin="03:48.642" end="03:49.285">gain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">尽管我明白 自从你再度唤醒她后</span></p><p begin="03:49.664" end="03:55.347" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="03:49.664" end="03:50.029">She</span> <span begin="03:50.029" end="03:50.287">de</span><span begin="03:50.287" end="03:51.377">pends</span> <span begin="03:51.377" end="03:51.909">on</span> <span begin="03:51.909" end="03:52.317">you,</span> <span begin="03:52.919" end="03:53.350">she</span> <span begin="03:53.350" end="03:53.452">de</span><span begin="03:53.452" end="03:54.529">pends</span> <span begin="03:54.529" end="03:55.054">on</span> <span begin="03:55.054" end="03:55.347">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她唯独的依靠只有你 只有你</span></p><p begin="03:55.589" end="04:01.882" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="03:55.589" end="03:55.927">She'll</span> <span begin="03:55.927" end="03:56.445">go</span> <span begin="03:56.445" end="03:56.594">a</span><span begin="03:56.594" end="03:57.070">lone,</span> <span begin="03:58.782" end="03:59.072">and</span> <span begin="03:59.072" end="03:59.407">ne</span><span begin="03:59.407" end="03:59.772">ver</span> <span begin="03:59.772" end="04:00.237">speak</span> <span begin="04:00.237" end="04:00.642">of</span> <span begin="04:00.642" end="04:01.024">this</span> <span begin="04:01.024" end="04:01.139">a</span><span begin="04:01.139" end="04:01.882">gain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她将孤身离去 不再提及往事</span></p><p begin="04:02.195" end="04:08.277" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="04:02.195" end="04:02.597">We</span> <span begin="04:02.597" end="04:02.795